19. Find Employees Having Same Salary
Input
emp_id	salary
1	      10000
2	      15000
3	      10000

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import count

dup_sal = df.groupBy("salary") \
            .agg(count("*").alias("cnt")) \
            .filter("cnt > 1")

result = df.join(dup_sal, "salary")

SQL:

SELECT *
FROM employee
WHERE salary IN (
    SELECT salary
    FROM employee
    GROUP BY salary
    HAVING COUNT(*) > 1
);
